  "message": "With no tasks or playable build shown, I can’t verify the route within 40–60 hours. This is common at the start and fixable within this checkpoint. Before approving, reduce the slice to one rough test area and add the three tasks below. We’ll review the first sprint together; I look forward to your build and progress posts ;).",
  "tasks": [],
  "add": [
    "Week 1: test whether two players can sail together in one rough area, and share a runnable build with connection instructions and notes on failures.",
    "Weeks 2–3: add the tide loop to that area and test how it affects co-op sailing, then share a playable build with controls and a short test checklist.",
    "Week 4: have five players try the prototype, including at least one two-player session, and share a report covering problems, observations and what to change next."
  ],
  "goal": {
    "fit": "narrow",
    "note": "With 40–60 hours and no build shown, two islands leave too little room to prove co-op sailing. Use: “A rough playable prototype in one test area, with the tide loop and co-op sailing tested by five players, plus a report of what worked and what failed.”",
